### [#](#acquirecontext) acquireContext

▸ **acquireContext**(`canvas`, `options?`): `CanvasRenderingContext2D`

Called at chart construction time, returns a context2d instance implementing
the [W3C Canvas 2D Context API standard][https://www.w3.org/TR/2dcontext/  (opens new window)](https://www.w3.org/TR/2dcontext/).

